.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 23, "prompt": "Further treatment : (23) ______                  lisinopril 2.5 mg daily,", "sourcePage": 122, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Angiotensin Converting Enzyme Inhibitor", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 24, "prompt": "Prophylactic use of an (24) ______", "sourcePage": 122, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Implantable Cardioverterâ€“defibrillator", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["c72b1bfd347e060ed089eea96d902064bb84baf583070e091778ed1a107e53f5"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [131]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}, {"id": "british-academy-task-11-B", "label": "British Academy · Task 11 · Part B", "part": "B", "sourceSha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "pages": [123, 124, 125], "questions": [{"number": 25, "prompt": "You hear a physician explaining to his staff about Azotemia.\n\nInsufficient flow of fluid through the kidney results in;\n\nA. Intrinsic azotemia\n\nB. Prerenal azotemia\n\nC. Postrenalazotemia", "sourcePage": 123, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear a physician explaining to his nurse about bilirubin blood level.\n\nWhich of the following statements best suits this extract?\n\nA. Increased level of bilirubin causes icterus.\n\nB. Enzyme deficiency increases the bilirubin level resulting in icterus.\n\nC. Enzyme deficiency results in Gilbert’s syndrome, making the sclerae appear yellow.", "sourcePage": 123, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear a physician explaining to his nurse about celiac disease.\n\nWhich of the following statements best suits this extract?\n\nA. Only 1% of people worldwide actually develop celiac disease.\n\nB. About 40% of people worldwide develop celiac disease.\n\nC. Gluten free diets are the best method to get rid of celiac disease.", "sourcePage": 124, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear a physician briefing his junior staff about Precision Medicine.\n\nWhich of the following statements best suits this extract?\n\nA. Precision medicine strategy is in increase to treat the disease based on the genes and\nenvironment of each patient.\n\nB. Precision medicine is not a new strategy, it has been in practice for many years, for instance,\nin blood transfusion.\n\nC. The role of precision medicine in disease treatment has been very rare so far.", "sourcePage": 124, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a physician briefing his junior staff about alopecia areata.\n\nIf the entire scalp becomes harless, the condition is called;\n\nA. Alopecia totalis\n\nB. Alopecia universalis\n\nC. Alopecia areata", "sourcePage": 125, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a physician briefing his junior staff about cytochrome c oxidase deficiency.\n\nWhich of the following diseases is caused by severe cytochrome c oxidase deficiency?\n\nA. Hepatomegaly\n\nB. Myopathy\n\nC. Hypotonia\n\nNow look at Part C\n\n\n\n                                               Part C\n   In this part of the test, you'll hear two different extracts. In each extract, you'll hear health\n   professionals talking about specific aspects of their work.\n\n   For questions 31 to 42 choose the answer (A, B, or C) which fits best according to what you\n   hear. Complete the answers as you listen the audio.\n\n   Now, look at extract one.", "sourcePage": 125, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["c72b1bfd347e060ed089eea96d902064bb84baf583070e091778ed1a107e53f5"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [131]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}, {"id": "british-academy-task-11-C", "label": "British Academy · Task 11 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "pages": [126, 127, 128, 129, 130], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "Which of the following statements is correct?\n\n   A. A small cylinder of tissue is removed in fine needle aspiration.\n\n   B. The diagnosis in fine needle biopsy can be made on the same day at times.\n\n   C. Needle used in fine needle aspiration are slightly larger than that used in core aspiration.", "sourcePage": 126, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "Which of the following is also known as the cytology test?\n\n   A. Core biopsy\n\n   B. Usage of a special vacuum tools in biopsy\n\n   C. Fine needle aspiration", "sourcePage": 126, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "Removal of complete tumor is called;\n\nA. Excisional biopsy\n\nB. Larger core aspiration\n\nC. Incisional biopsy", "sourcePage": 127, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "A vertical cut is made from the upper to lower abdomen to remove samples through;\n\nA. Laparotomy\n\nB. Mediastinoscopy\n\nC. Laparoscopic biopsy", "sourcePage": 127, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "A squamous cell cancer is removed through;\n\nA. Laparotomy\n\nB. Excisional biopsy\n\nC. Shave biopsy", "sourcePage": 127, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Which of the following statements is incorrect?\n\nA. Lymph nodes are the primary parts that are affected due to cancer metastasis.\n\nB. Shave biopsies are used for suspected melanomas of the skin.\n\nC. Sentinel lymph node mapping helps to decide which lymph nodes to remove for biopsy.", "sourcePage": 128, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "Which of the following type of blotches are not formed by abnormal cells of Kaposi\nsarcoma?\n\nA. Purple blotches\n\nB. Black blotches\n\nC. Brown blotches", "sourcePage": 128, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Often skin lesions of Kaposi sarcoma appear on the;\n\n      A. Neck\n\n      B. Leg\n\n      C. Hands", "sourcePage": 129, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Which of the following statements is correct?\n\n      A. A patient is considered to have AIDS when Kaposi sarcoma occurs in the HIV patients.\n\n      B. AIDS outbreaks occur only when the virus completely damages the immune system.\n\n      C. HIV infected patients are AIDS patients.", "sourcePage": 129, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "Which of the following statements is incorrect?\n\n      A. Classic Kaposi sarcoma occurs in Eastern Europe.\n\n      B. Classic Kaposi sarcoma is more common in women than men.\n\n      C. The lesions in classic Kaposi sarcoma do not grow quickly.", "sourcePage": 129, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "Which of the following statements is incorrect?\n\nA. Endemic Kaposi sarcoma occurs in younger people, under 40.\n\nB. Malaria is a cause of Endemic Kaposi sarcoma.\n\nC. Endemic Kaposi sarcoma occurs in people over 40.", "sourcePage": 130, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 131, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Liste